WEBVTT

00:50:29.292 --> 00:50:31.934
And it's actually
a wonderful new permission

00:50:31.958 --> 00:50:38.101
that more people can have access
to that kind of intensity in their work.

00:50:38.125 --> 00:50:41.476
What comes with that
is that the other side of passion

00:50:41.500 --> 00:50:45.893
is massive heartbreak, disillusion.

00:50:45.917 --> 00:50:48.268
disruption, degradation.

00:50:48.292 --> 00:50:51.101
I mean, passion has its side effects.

00:50:51.125 --> 00:50:53.393
And I think that today you have that too.

00:50:53.417 --> 00:50:55.184
When people --

00:50:55.208 --> 00:50:58.851
People don't just leave
because the factory closes.

00:50:58.875 --> 00:51:01.476
That happens, but this
is not the primary thing.